Business Logic, modular take (Bounded contexts)

ex:

Discussion/                               # Module
├── Tradelens.Discussion.Domain/          # entities, repository interfaces
├── Tradelens.Discussion.Application/     # CreatePostCommand, GetPostsQuery
├── Tradelens.Discussion.Infrastructure/  # DiscussionDbContext, repository impl
└── Tradelens.Discussion.Api/             # Api controllers (endpoints)